-- GAME ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Title       Knight Tyme
  Publisher   Mastertronic Added Dimension, 1986
  Version     1.3

-- YOU NEED ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Your own copy of the original game, saved beside this patch:

  File        Knight Tyme (1986)(Mastertronic Added Dimension)(128K)[Magic
              Knight 3].z80
  MD5         8e720b5cc11fe0d9445fe0af4825c8bf

  The patch carries none of the game's code. It only works with that exact
  dump, under that name or any other: anything else is refused, with a
  message naming the file it wants.

-- WHAT IT DOES --------------------------------------------------------------
  Moving figures become Next hardware sprites, so they keep their own colours
  and no longer take on the scenery's (colour clash). Game logic is unchanged.

  Pace        original

  Changes     1.1: writes the whole alt ROM image (Sinclair's ROM plus the
              hooks), so the ROM's own interrupt code can never run the hooks.
              1.2: the game keeps its own CPU speed after each sprite update
              instead of being set back to 3.5 MHz; no change to what you see.
              1.3: the Knight's pictures are made about three times faster, so
              the start of play and his colour changes no longer slow the
              game; the same pictures, pixel for pixel.

  Note        Known issues: the star map reads data from the Next's ROM rather
              than the 128K machine's; whether it looks different is not
              checked; plays 0.1% slower than the original in JNext (the same
              pace once walking; the first second of play +3%). Missing: no
              Enhanced colour set; the cheats are unplayed by a person
              (strength and fuel not run); not reached in testing: the story
              puzzles, transporter trips by play and the ending; hardware
              untested.

-- MENU ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   1  Infinite time
   2  Infinite strength
   3  Infinite fuel
   4  Strength (others)
   5  Happiness (others)
   6  Stamina (others)
   7  Charisma (others)

  Cheats come from the archive's POKEs for this release.

